 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Taiga no Mori no Kari Gurashi - Keiyaku Fuufu no Touou Gohan"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "タイガの森の狩り暮らし ～契約夫婦の東欧ごはん～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I want you to be my husband.\"\n\nMikhail collapses while fleeing from his pursuers in the snowy coniferous forest (taiga) and is taken in by Olga, a female hunter. Mikhail, a former baker who is unable to return to town due to circumstances, and Olga and Mikhail's interests coincide, leading to a contract marriage. As a husband, he protects the home and cooks every day while living in a village of hunters who make a living from hunting. The couple's daily life continues as they enjoy the bounty of nature.\n\nA couple with their own problems, nurtured by the harsh yet majestic nature, enjoys delicious Eastern European food, hunting, and a slow life in a snowy country!"
  },
